<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15492" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρρεν-ωπός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>,
		also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Luc.
			<u>Fug.</u>
			27
		</span></i>: (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὤψ</span>):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>masculine-looking, manly,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				802e
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γυναῖκες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>GA</u>
					747a1
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.35
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
			</span></i>inc.<i><span class="en">
				2.15
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐμορφία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Scyth.</u>
					11
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἀ.,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρρενωπία</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				4.6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> ofthings,
				<i>befitting a man, manly,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στολή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
				</span></i>
			<i>N A</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				2.11
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἀ. τῆς ψυχῆς</span>”
				<i>manliness,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Chor.
					<u>Lyd.</u>
					8
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-πῶς</span>
			<u>Gloss.</u>:— irreg. fem. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρρεν-ωπάς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">άδος</span>, ἡ, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνδρόγυνος</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Cratin.
				389
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
